ia.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/12/21/2306766/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヘアメイクさんのアレンジで\n薔薇付きリボンを編み込んで\n飾り付けしてくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても良き。ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆうたろうにちゅーする1秒前。\nゆうたろう♡可愛いぞ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(※優里さんです)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年最後の握手会ということもあり\nいろいろと濃い話が皆様と\n出来たかなあと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして欅坂46の皆さんにスタッフさんと\n遊びに行った際にぜひ出てみてはという\nお言葉に甘え、鈴本美愉ちゃんの生誕祭に\n出させていただきました、、。\nありがとう〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意外と人見知りな部分もあったりするので\n生誕祭に出るときに躊躇していたら\n今泉ちゃんが一緒に行きましょう〜と\n言ってくれてお言葉に甘えちゃいました(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めて、鈴本ちゃんおめでとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/12/21/2306766/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何もしてないナチュラル。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Yes,natural."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼＼\\\\٩( 'ω' )و //／／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/12/21/2306766/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏さんリスペクト軍団で\nニコ生出演させていただきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様見ていただけましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当はさゆりんご軍団との出演の\nはずだったのですが、\nりんごさんの体調不良により\nさゆりんご軍団はお休みとなりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また次あることを楽しみに\nしていてください\n本当に申し訳ありません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏軍団では笑いあり涙ありの\n今までの中で1番楽しい回となりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わった後もまなったんと私は\n床に転げ落ちて大爆笑。\n帰るまでずっと面白くて楽しかったなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/12/21/2306766/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当はこれを名古屋で着ようと\n思ったのですが、、\n衣装さんがとても素敵なサンタコスを\n用意して下さっていたので\nそちらを着ました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、来年着ますね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐでクリスマスですね〜\n皆様クリスマスの予定はなんですか？\n私は有難い事にお仕事です(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張って参るぞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また見てね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-33635":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは、渡辺です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/07/30/3960927/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"梅雨明けでこんなにも暑くなるか\nというくらい、ここ最近また\n暑くなってきて毎日汗ダラッダラです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地味に汗っかきな私には辛いです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く冬になってほしいな〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"_______________________________"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のブログのコメント\nたくさんでとても嬉しかったです\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(後々、5人だけっていうのは少なかった\nかなあと少し反省 ...)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/07/30/3960927/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/07/30/3960927/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メッセージをぎっしりと詰め込み 。\nありがとうございました(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何だかこういう些細な企画だけど\nそれでも何だか胸がじんわーり\nするくらいコメントって嬉しいんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様ありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎告知◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・BLT 発売中"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・BOMB別冊 発売中"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/07/30/3960927/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/07/30/3960927/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"花奈さんと初グラビア撮影！\n密着してたくさん撮りました〜\nかき氷が本当に美味でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひご覧ください！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブ発表されましたね。\nお待ちしています(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また見てね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-6183":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/8767944/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日は、名古屋でCBCラジオまつり２０１２に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出演させて頂きました(o^_^o)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/8767944/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく緊張しましたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても楽しかったです＾＾○°"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暑い中、沢山の方が応援にきてくださって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとに嬉しかったです(*^_^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/8767944/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/8767944/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"熱中症などは大丈夫でしたでしょうか(>_<)？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に有難うございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は暑かったので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっきりとポニーテールにしました ＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/8767944/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり、歌って踊ってるときが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番好きだな(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんのダンスすごく見やすい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って、言われて嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、今回のステージを終えて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく楽しかったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分への課題も更に見つかったし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"反省点も沢山あったと感じました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次に皆さんの前に立つまでには完璧にしておきたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一段でも高いクオリティーを、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一歩でも進んだパフォーマンスを。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのときそのときを、ただ楽しかっただけで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は終わらせたくないから。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/8767944/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分に甘えず、現状に満足せず、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上を目指して頑張って行きたい＼(^o^)／きらぴかっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど、とにかく乃木坂46のメンバーと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それを支えて応援してくださるみなさんのことが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きだなって改めて感じましたヾ(＠⌒▽⌒＠)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰りに、味噌カツをいただきました（ミ＾o＾ミ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても美味しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/8767944/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋よ、有難うヾ(＠⌒ー⌒＠)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、たくさん汗をかいたと思うので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆっくりお風呂に入って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"身体、休めてくださいねっ(o^_^o)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/8767944/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来れなかった方も、学校・お仕事の方も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お疲れさま(●＾＾●）＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも有難う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/8767944/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさゆにゃん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/8767944/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/8767944/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/8767944/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/8767944/0011.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"sba-nogi-58188":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n \n どーも^ - ^\n \n \n 秋刀魚がどうしても食べたいんですけど\n まだ食べれていないので\n 無事、食べれたら報告致します！！！\n \n \n さて\n 先日募集させていただきました\n \" 未央奈にしてほしいハロウィンコスプレ \"\n たくさんのご意見ありがとうございました☺︎\n 見させていただきました〜\n \n \n どれをしようか考えた結果、\n 再現しやすそう、リクエスト多数　なものを\n 優先してなるべくたくさんのコスプレを\n できたらいいなと思っています^ - ^\n 二次元様には到底敵いませんが\n 温かい目で見守っていただけたら...\n \n \n \n 第一弾はお家にある服で再現できたので\n この方から！\n \n \"彼女、お借りします\"\n の更科瑠夏ちゃん\n リクエスト多かったー！\n 髪型かな？\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFRDPWKDKG5K26D8GWJAMT7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFRDQYSEDMA4KAJ3ZKP71TW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFRDS1HE8C23MWV3CWKSX31","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n 好きな人にはグイグイタイプの瑠夏ちゃん\n \n \n 瑠夏ちゃんの可愛さには頭が上がりません...\n どうか瑠夏ちゃんファンの皆さま\n お許しください......m(_ _)m\n \n \n \n \n さて\n 次はあのキャラクターをする予定です！\n 帽子がチャームポイントかな！\n お楽しみに〜\n 10月たくさんリクエストコスプレ写真\n あげる予定ですっ\n \n \n \n \n そして10月3日の有吉反省会2時間spに\n 真夏さんと出させていただきます^ - ^\n だいすきな姉と一緒で楽しめました！\n \n 緊張してすごいクールな感じになってしまたけど。笑\n \n ぜひ見てください^ - ^\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFRDT2JH7JWP5TH86TMQQP8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n 秋刀魚秋刀魚\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-31808":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" こんにちは！\n \n 日向坂46の加藤史帆です🐻\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ3H9H63MSFN5MED4HNMHHZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 嬉しいお知らせです！\n \n \n 12月27日（金）12:00から放送される「MUSIC STATION ウルトラSUPERLIVE2019」に日向坂46の出演が決定しました✨✨\n \n 年末のMステさんに出演するの、凄く憧れていたので今からとっても楽しみです！\n \n \n 皆さんも楽しみにしててくださいね🧸\n \n \n \n 今日はミニオンとの写真載せよーっと！！🍌\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ3HAKT5T92ZJYQZDHAKKJ3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ3HBMD8FTVSX6Y192950XV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ3HCPKJGK39QKE32Q46HZT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 最後までお読みいただきありがとうございました(・ω・)\n \n としちゃん"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-nogi-42129":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":" 昨日ね 流星群みたくて探したけどみれなかった 次は何年後なんだろ みたかったなー "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF0373TSAY1P16H13C95Q6A","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">   お知らせ ⚪︎12/8発売  週刊プレイボーイ 梅ちゃんと！みなみとみなみ "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF038339NQPDPQ6YPGXDHGK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">  ⚪︎12/9発売  BOMB ゆったんとひなちまと大人っぽい感じで撮ってもらったよ！ ⚪︎12/10発売  MARQUEE うさぎ〜 ひなちゃんのプロデュースさすがですみなみの好きな感じすぎて楽しかった(*'▽'*) "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF0392923K6HW9YCRNBDSWA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"> ⚪︎12/11発売  ヤングマガジン れいかと真夏と！珍しい組み合わせ〜 ⚪︎12/20発売  B.L.T まいちゅん、ゆったん、みさで振袖着ました！ "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF03A2P734PGKNE904X1MXE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"> ⚪︎12/22発売  BRODY 行きたかったイルミネーションと紅葉に連れてってもらったよ〜 "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHF03B1WQ9SP9HN79EMAKEQY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"> ⚪︎12/28発売  月刊エンタメ のんびり〜って感じです♫   ⚪︎12/17はらじらーにゲストででるよ〜きいてね！    "}],"source":"archive"}}